<section class="channel-study" data-channel-study hidden aria-label="Live channel pressure-loss study">
  <div class="study-head"><div><small>PRESSURE-LOSS STUDY</small><h3 data-study-heading>Choose the channel gap.</h3></div><span data-solver-state role="status">Checking solver…</span></div>
  <p class="study-lead" data-study-explanation>Compare three gaps against your pressure-drop budget, then run nine OpenFOAM solves to check the choice.</p>
  <div data-study-part="0">
    <div class="study-inputs">
      <label>Channel length <span>mm</span><input data-study-input="length_mm" aria-label="Channel length mm" type="number" min="100" max="500" step="1" value="200"/></label>
      <label>Nominal gap <span>mm</span><input data-study-input="gap_mm" aria-label="Nominal gap mm" type="number" min="1" max="3" step="0.05" value="2"/></label>
      <label>Volume flow <span>mL/s</span><input data-study-input="flow_ml_s" aria-label="Volume flow mL/s" type="number" min="1" max="40" step="0.1" value="20"/></label>
      <label>Pressure-drop budget <span>Pa</span><input data-study-input="budget_pa" aria-label="Pressure-drop budget Pa" type="number" min="1" max="1000" step="1" value="70"/></label>
    </div>
    <p class="scope">Water at nominal 20 °C · 100 mm reference width · laminar, fully developed parallel-plate flow.</p>
    <details><summary>Model assumptions and supported range</summary><p>Length 100–500 mm; nominal gap 1–3 mm; flow 1–40 mL/s. The tested gaps are 75%, 100% and 125% of nominal. Density 998.2 kg/m³; viscosity 0.001003 Pa·s. The 2D model omits sidewall drag, entry losses, bends, fittings and heat transfer. The parabolic inlet assumes an upstream developed flow.</p></details>
    <label class="study-confirm"><input type="checkbox" data-study-confirm/> Use these inputs and assumptions for this study.</label>
    <div class="study-actions"><button data-study-prepare>Prepare study →</button><button data-study-brief>Download study brief</button></div>
  </div>
  <div data-study-part="1" hidden><div data-study-math></div><div class="study-preview" data-study-estimates></div><p class="scope">Analytical estimates update with your inputs. The solver comparison follows after you start the study.</p><a href="https://farside.ph.utexas.edu/teaching/336L/Fluidhtml/node134.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Analytical reference: flow between parallel plates ↗</a></div>
  <div data-study-part="2,3,5" hidden>
    <div class="study-view-toolbar"><label>Inspect gap <select data-study-variant aria-label="Inspect channel gap"></select></label><label data-study-field-label hidden>Field <select data-study-field><option value="speed_m_s">Velocity (m/s)</option><option value="pressure_pa">Pressure (Pa)</option></select></label></div>
    <div class="study-viewport" data-study-viewport aria-label="Interactive 3D channel geometry"></div>
    <p class="scope" data-study-viewport-caption>Drag to rotate · scroll to zoom. Gap and solver slice depth shown ×20 for inspection.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-study-part="3" hidden><p data-study-mesh-note>Three structured grids per gap: 512, 1,152 and 2,048 cells. Every generated mesh must pass checkMesh.</p></div>
  <div data-study-part="4" hidden>
    <div class="study-run-card"><strong data-study-run-title>Ready for a fresh calculation</strong><p>3 gap variants × 3 grids. One queued study at a time. Usually under a minute; maximum runtime five minutes.</p><button data-study-run>Start nine OpenFOAM solves</button><p class="scope">Clicking Start sends the four numeric inputs to the solver. Evidence is retained for 48 hours.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="study-job" data-study-job hidden><div><strong data-study-job-label>Queued</strong><span data-study-count>0 / 9</span></div><progress data-study-progress max="9" value="0"></progress><p data-study-job-message role="status"></p></div>
  <div data-study-part="5" hidden>
    <div class="study-decision" data-study-decision>No solver result yet. Start the study at the Solve stage.</div>
    <div class="study-table-scroll" data-study-comparison></div>
    <div class="study-checks" data-study-checks></div>
    <p class="scope" data-study-interpretation></p>
    <div class="study-actions" data-study-downloads hidden><button data-study-report>Download report</button><a data-study-evidence>Download solver evidence</a><button data-study-inspect>Read proof</button></div>
    <iframe data-study-proof hidden title="Channel study proof document" sandbox="allow-popups"></iframe>
  </div>
  <p class="study-notice" data-study-notice role="status"></p>
  <details data-study-history hidden></details>
  <div class="study-nav"><button data-study-back>← Previous</button><button data-study-next>Review math →</button></div>
</section>
<style>
  .channel-study{color:var(--doc-ink);font-size:13px}.study-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center}.study-head small{color:var(--doc-accent);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em}.study-head h3{font-size:23px;margin:5px 0}.study-head>span{font-size:10px;color:var(--doc-muted);white-space:nowrap}.study-head>span[data-online=true]{color:#72d4b2}.study-head>span[data-online=false]{color:#e79e98}.study-lead{color:var(--doc-muted);line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0 20px}.study-inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.study-inputs label{display:block;font-weight:650;font-size:12px}.study-inputs span{float:right;color:var(--doc-muted);font-weight:400}.study-inputs input{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:11px;margin-top:7px;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:6px;background:var(--doc-input);color:var(--doc-ink);font-size:16px}.scope{color:var(--doc-muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}details{border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);padding:12px;border-radius:6px;margin:15px 0;color:var(--doc-muted);font-size:12px}summary{cursor:pointer}details p{line-height:1.7}.study-confirm{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;margin:18px 0;line-height:1.5}.study-actions,.study-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:18px 0}.study-actions button,.study-actions a,.study-nav button,.study-run-card button{font:inherit;font-weight:650;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--doc-button);color:var(--doc-ink);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}.study-actions button:first-child,.study-run-card button{background:#66d0ca;color:#0c2b33}.study-nav{justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--doc-rule);padding-top:14px;margin-bottom:0}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.study-notice{color:var(--doc-warning);line-height:1.5}.study-job{margin:18px 0;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;background:var(--doc-card)}.study-job>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.study-job progress{width:100%;height:9px;accent-color:#eab84c}.study-job[data-state=complete] progress{accent-color:#52c7a5}.study-job[data-state=failed] progress{accent-color:#e77979}.study-job p{font-size:12px;color:var(--doc-muted);margin-bottom:0}.study-run-card{padding:20px;background:var(--doc-card);border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:8px;line-height:1.6}.study-run-card strong{font-size:18px}.study-decision{padding:16px;border-left:3px solid #55c2b5;background:var(--doc-card);line-height:1.65;margin:20px 0}.study-table-scroll{overflow:auto}a{color:var(--doc-accent)}.study-view-toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;margin:12px 0}.study-view-toolbar select{background:var(--doc-input);color:var(--doc-ink);padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:5px}.study-viewport{height:270px;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:8px;background:#0e1a23;overflow:hidden}.study-viewport :global(canvas){width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.study-checks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:15px 0}.study-checks :global(span){padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:5px;font-size:11px}.study-checks :global([data-pass=true]){color:#72d4b2}.study-checks :global([data-pass=false]){color:#e49f77}.channel-study :global(table){width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}.channel-study :global(td),.channel-study :global(th){padding:10px 6px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--doc-rule)}.channel-study :global(.equation){padding:14px 5px;overflow-x:auto}.channel-study iframe{width:100%;height:560px;border:1px solid var(--doc-rule);border-radius:8px}.study-preview{margin-top:15px}@media(max-width:500px){.study-inputs{gap:10px}.study-head h3{font-size:20px}.study-head{align-items:flex-start}.study-head>span{max-width:90px;white-space:normal}.study-viewport{height:230px}}
</style>
